      "id": "J001",
      "request": "In `SnapshotFormatter.boundLine`, preserve complete UTF-16 surrogate pairs when truncating a line to `MAX_LINE_CHARS`. Keep the existing control-character and section-sign sanitization, the `...` suffix when truncation is necessary, and unchanged behavior for ordinary ASCII lines. Truncation must never introduce an unpaired surrogate or return a string longer than the bound.\n\nWrite scope: `src/main/java/dev/atmcompanion/state/SnapshotFormatter.java`.",
