      "test_class": "dev.atmcompanion.state.ObservationMapAcceptanceTest",
      "test_sha256": "300538d10ceadaa6c63d750a398849165fdf37b282fbcfe87f99e84e5f60abc9",
      "test_cases": 3
    },
    {
      "id": "J004",
      "request": "Add `ExecutionContext.Scan.coveragePercent()` returning the integer floor of `100 * scannedPositions / totalPositions`, with zero when totalPositions is zero. Coverage counts scanned positions even when some are unloaded; it is not the same as `complete()`. Add `ExecutionAssessment.observedCoveragePercent()` delegating to its observation's scan; return `-1` when the assessment has no observation. Preserve all current assessment and scan invariants.\n\nWrite scope: `src/main/java/dev/atmcompanion/execution/ExecutionContext.java`, `src/main/java/dev/atmcompanion/execution/ExecutionAssessment.java`.",
      "request_sha256": "962dd0852821cf3efb43c3f8d97aebbc7aa8135f8fc2b2db5c410bb38e2f6d3e",
      "files": [
